# ---- Game files -------------------------------------------------------------
# Never committed: this repo contains no Alabaster Dawn assets, code or files.
# `fix/terra-index.html.orig` is a working copy of the game's own terra/index.html
# kept locally as a patch reference; regenerate it from your own installation:
#   cp "<game dir>/terra/index.html" fix/terra-index.html.orig
fix/terra-index.html.orig
terra/
*.save
*.pak

# ---- Local scratch ----------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/*.jsonl
gp_out.json
# The Mali reporter's patched shaders and the ZIP they arrived in are game files: kept in the working
# tree next to his log for reference (FINDINGS §22.8), never committed, like `terra/` above.
logs/mali/fixmali/
logs/mali/fixmali.zip
# The Mali shader probe's cases are generated from a local install by tools/mali-probe/make-cases.py:
# game files again, so never committed (`tools/mali-probe/README.md`).
tools/mali-probe/cases/
tools/mali-probe/local.properties
